  <!--EN: A rich, crimson liquid crafted from concentrated hemogen packs. When the user drinks it, it enhances all traits and abilities tied to their hemogenic nature, boosting physical and mental capacities. Additionally, this draught replenishes the user's hemogen supply over time, maintaining their vitality and enhancing their overall function.-->
  <VFEM2_HemogenDraught.description>一种类似于葡萄酒的饮料，由发酵的蜂蜜和水制成，在简单的木桶中陈酿。这种甜爽爽口的饮料众所周知，可以随着时间的推移而被呵护，并享有特别舒适的声誉。饮用蜂蜜酒会降低精神敏感性。</VFEM2_HemogenDraught.description>
  <!--EN: hemogen draught-->
  <VFEM2_HemogenDraught.label>蜂蜜酒</VFEM2_HemogenDraught.label>
